<title>FINLAND: UPM-Kymmene Q1 profit falls 2 pct.</title>
<headline>UPM-Kymmene Q1 profit falls 2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to end-March-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax   1,345 vs 1,372</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   4.18 vs 4.22</p>
<p> Net sales					 13,086 vs 13,270</p>
<p> Operating profit				 1,819 vs 2,014</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecasts for Finnish forest industry group UPM-Kymmene Oy's Q1 profit before extraordinary items and tax had been 1.35 billion markka (range FIM 952 million to 1.58 billion).  </p>
<p> Depreciation					 817 vs 788</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 437 vs 450 charge</p>
<p> Exchange rate differences		charge 29 vs 161 charge</p>
<p> Share of results of</p>
<p> associated companies			 gain 24 vs 44 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	1,345 vs 1,372</p>
<p> Taxes						  192 vs 203</p>
<p> Minorities				   charge 32 vs 41 charge</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations		 1,121 vs 1,128</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    41.0 vs 40.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish forest industry group is UPM-Kymmene Oy.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
